cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Digit Probe in academic or research work, please cite it as below."
title: "Digit Probe"
abstract: >
  Digit Probe is research-oriented software for descriptive statistical and
  structural analysis of ordered numeric and discrete-symbol sequences. It
  provides a small Python API and CLI for reproducible measurements while
  leaving domain interpretation to the consumer. Digit Probe does not by
  itself establish anomaly, defect, threat, causality, malicious intent,
  process correctness, or certified randomness or non-randomness.
type: software
authors:
